# Resume of a product designer. One A4 page without margins: a two-column grid over
# the full page, with a colored sidebar (photo, contact, tools with level bars
# and languages) and the body with profile, key figures, experience as a timeline and education.
# The paragraphs and one achievement carry Markup: markdown for the bold and italics inside the sentence. The
# section labels are written in lowercase and the rules put them in uppercase (Case).
